<title>USA: Washington Gas issues $25 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Washington Gas issues $25 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Washington Gas Light Co Wednesday said it has issued $25 million in unsecured medium-term notes.</p>
<p>The Washington-based utility said proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>It said the notes have a coupon rate of 6.82 percent and mature in 2026. Washington Gas said holders have a one-time option to have the company redeem the notes at face value on Oct. 9, 2006.</p>
</text>
